  "provenance": "OneNote 2010 14.0.7015.1000 on Windows 7; Rust over macOS SMB to Samba zenith. Disposable synthetic notebooks. Separate native cold-cache reads after live competing edits, offline native edit/reconnect, whole-file lock contention, and lost successful SMB FLUSH replies. Native conflict UI confirms offline competing text; COM hierarchy omits conflict pages. fault-01 result transcribed from tool output; fault-02/03 capture subprocess results. Contention controller completed edit/sync while locked and closed at its deadline; queued commands 4-6 were submitted after it had closed and are excluded. All snapshots are final files, not live reads.",
